    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95769" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπάρτη</span></b> , ἡ,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπάρτον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rope</i> or <i>cord</i> (v. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπάρτος, ὁ</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				815
			</span></i> (with a play upon <u>Sparta</u>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				110
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαντεύεσθαι . . τῇ τῶν σπαρτῶν
				διατάσει</span> dub. l. in <i><span class="en">
